<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Currículo e portfólio de [Seu Nome], desenvolvedor(a) de software." />
  <title>[Seu Nome] | Desenvolvedor(a) de Software</title>

  <style>
    /* =========================================================
       VARIÁVEIS — altere as cores principais aqui
       ========================================================= */
    :root {
      --bg: #05070d;
      --panel: #0b1020;
      --panel-2: #0f172a;
      --text: #e5eefb;
      --muted: #93a4bd;
      --cyan: #22d3ee;
      --green: #34d399;
      --purple: #a78bfa;
      --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--sans);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Grade tecnológica de fundo */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 48px 48px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 18%, black, transparent 78%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 18%, black, transparent 78%);
    }

    /* Brilho ambiente */
    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 30%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.10), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.07), transparent 35%);
    }

    header, main, footer { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .container {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       NAVBAR
       ========================================================= */
    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.78);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .nav {
      height: 68px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--cyan);
      letter-spacing: -0.4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--green); }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 22px;
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--cyan); }

    .nav-toggle {
      display: none;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    /* =========================================================
       HERO
       ========================================================= */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 140px 0 80px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--green), var(--purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 58ch;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); text-decoration: none; }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.18), rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.16));
      border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
      color: #dffcff;
    }

    .btn-ghost { color: var(--text); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); }

    /* Terminal */
    .terminal {
      background: #080d18;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.22);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow:
        0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.05) inset;
    }

    .terminal-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.06);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .terminal-bar span {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .terminal-bar span:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f57; }
    .terminal-bar span:nth-child(2) { background: #febc2e; }
    .terminal-bar span:nth-child(3) { background: #28c840; }

    .terminal-bar p {
      margin: 0 0 0 8px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .terminal-body {
      padding: 18px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #c9d8ee;
    }

    .terminal-body p { margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .prompt { color: var(--green); }
    .out { color: var(--cyan); }
    .cursor {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--green);
      animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

    /* Card de perfil */
    .profile-card {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.95));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Para usar foto real, substitua a div .avatar por:
       <img class="avatar-img" src="assets/img/perfil.jpg" alt="Foto de [Seu Nome]">
    */
    .avatar {
      width: 118px;
      height: 118px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--green));
      color: #031018;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      box-shadow: 0 0 38px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.25);
    }

    .profile-card h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .profile-card > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .stat {
      padding: 12px 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.04);
    }

    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .stat small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.72rem; }

    /* =========================================================
       SEÇÕES
       ========================================================= */
    section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      scroll-margin-top: 80px;
    }

    .section-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .section-title .num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--green);
      border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.35);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72), rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.72));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-grid p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0; }

    .highlight-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .highlight-list li {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: #c9d8ee;
      padding-left: 18px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .highlight-list li::before {
      content: "▸";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    /* Habilidades */
    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .skill-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .chips {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .chip {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: #c7f9ff;
      background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
    }

    /* Timeline */
    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 28px;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 7px;
      top: 4px;
      bottom: 4px;
      width: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(var(--cyan), var(--purple), transparent);
    }

    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .timeline-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .timeline-item::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -26px;
      top: 7px;
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.8);
    }

    .timeline-item h3 { margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 1rem; }
    .timeline-item .date {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .timeline-item ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* Projetos */
    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .project-card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78), rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.78));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .project-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    /* Para usar imagem real, substitua a div .project-media por:
       <img class="project-img" src="assets/img/projeto-1.jpg" alt="Descrição do projeto">
    */
    .project-media {
      height: 150px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.22), transparent 55%),
        #0a1120;
      background-size: 22px 22px, 22px 22px, auto, auto;
    }

    .project-media span {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--cyan);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .project-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 150px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .project-body {
      padding: 18px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .project-body h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .project-body p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .project-tech {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .project-links {
      margin-top: auto;
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* Contato */
    .contact-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .contact-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 60ch; }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 28px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }

    /* Animação de entrada */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(18px);
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
    }

    .reveal.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* =========================================================
       RESPONSIVO
       ========================================================= */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .nav-toggle { display: block; }

      .nav-links {
        position: absolute;
        top: 68px;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        display: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        background: rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.98);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }

      .hero { padding-top: 120px; }
      .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px); }
      .buttons { flex-direction: column; }
      .btn { width: 100%; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
      .cursor { animation: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- ================= NAVBAR ================= -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="logo" href="#inicio">&lt;<span>seu_nome</span>/&gt;</a>

      <button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Abrir menu" aria-expanded="false">
        ☰
      </button>

      <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li>
        <li><a href="#habilidades">Stack</a></li>
        <li><a href="#experiencia">Experiência</a></li>
        <li><a href="#projetos">Projetos</a></li>
        <li><a href="#formacao">Formação</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="container hero-grid">

        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">// portfólio & currículo</p>

          <h1>
            Olá, eu sou<br />
            <span class="gradient-text">[Seu Nome]</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-copy">
            [Resumo curto: desenvolvedor(a) focado(a) em construir aplicações web,
            APIs e soluções escaláveis. Escreva aqui sua especialidade principal e
            o tipo de problema que você gosta de resolver.]
          </p>

          <div class="buttons">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projetos">Ver projetos</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/[seu-usuario]" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://linkedin.com/in/[seu-perfil]" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="terminal reveal">
          <div class="terminal-bar">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            <p>bash — portfolio</p>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body">
            <p><span class="prompt">$</span> whoami</p>
            <p class="out">[Seu Nome] — Desenvolvedor(a) de Software</p>

            <p><span class="prompt">$</span> cat stack.txt</p>
            <p class="out">React · Node.js · Python · SQL · Docker · AWS</p>

            <p><span class="prompt">$</span> <span id="typed"></span><span class="cursor">▋</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= SOBRE ================= -->
    <section id="sobre">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="num">01</span> Sobre mim</h2>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="panel reveal">
            <p>
              [Escreva 2 ou 3 parágrafos sobre sua trajetória. Exemplo: atuo como
              desenvolvedor(a) full stack com experiência em criação de interfaces,
              APIs REST e integração com bancos de dados. Gosto de trabalhar com
              código limpo, testes automatizados e melhoria contínua.]
            </p>
            <p>
              [Fale também sobre soft skills: comunicação, trabalho em equipe,
              resolução de problemas, aprendizado rápido e interesse por arquitetura
              de software/cloud.]
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel reveal">
            <ul class="highlight-list">
              <li>Foco em aplicações web modernas e responsivas</li>
              <li>Experiência com APIs, bancos de dados e integrações</li>
              <li>Boas práticas: Git, testes, CI/CD e código limpo</li>
              <li>Inglês técnico para documentação e estudos</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= HABILIDADES ================= -->
    <section id="habilidades">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="num">02</span> Stack tecnológico</h2>

        <div class="skills-grid">
          <div class="panel skill-card reveal">
            <h3>Front-end</h3>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">HTML5</span>
              <span class="chip">CSS3</span>
              <span class="chip">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="chip">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="chip">React</span>
              <span class="chip">Next.js</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel skill-card reveal">
            <h3>Back-end & Dados</h3>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">Node.js</span>
              <span class="chip">Express</span>
              <span class="chip">Python</span>
              <span class="chip">FastAPI</span>
              <span class="chip">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="chip">MongoDB</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel skill-card reveal">
            <h3>DevOps & Ferramentas</h3>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">Git</span>
              <span class="chip">GitHub Actions</span>
              <span class="chip">Docker</span>
              <span class="chip">AWS</span>
              <span class="chip">Linux</span>
              <span class="chip">Postman</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= EXPERIÊNCIA ================= -->
    <section id="experiencia">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="num">03</span> Experiência profissional</h2>

        <div class="panel reveal">
          <div class="timeline">

            <div class="timeline-item">
              <h3>[Cargo] — [Empresa]</h3>
              <p class="date">[Mês/Ano] – [Atual ou Mês/Ano]</p>
              <ul>
                <li>[Descreva uma responsabilidade com resultado mensurável.]</li>
                <li>[Exemplo: desenvolvimento de APIs REST com Node.js e PostgreSQL.]</li>
                <li>[Exemplo: criação de interfaces em React consumindo serviços internos.]</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline-item">
              <h3>[Cargo anterior] — [Empresa anterior]</h3>
              <p class="date">[Mês/Ano] – [Mês/Ano]</p>
              <ul>
                <li>[Descreva atividade técnica relevante.]</li>
                <li>[Inclua ferramentas, linguagens e impacto do trabalho.]</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= PROJETOS ================= -->
    <section id="projetos">
      <div class="container">
